      "description": "How long a Task waits before a Worker picks it up.\n\nTHE fleet-capacity signal, and the one to autoscale on \u2014 never CPU. A Worker blocked in a long poll uses almost no CPU, so a CPU-based autoscaler scales DOWN a fleet that is falling behind.\n\nUNITS: Go and Java emit seconds. TypeScript, Python and .NET emit milliseconds, and this panel would then be wrong by 1000x. Run `make verify-sdk-labels`.",
